<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 73.5526 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 73.5526 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 73.5526 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 73.6064 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 3		   Dec 2</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.5526		 73.6064</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 8.580		  11.480</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
